# Project overview

arthurgeron.com is Arthur Geron's consulting site: one prerendered SolidJS page, served as static files. There is no server and no router.

## Invariants
- The page must read and navigate without JavaScript. `scripts/prerender.ts` writes the full HTML into `dist/index.html` and the client hydrates it.
- Every figure on the page comes from `src/data/stats.json` or from a constant. Never hardcode a GitHub or npm number in a component.
- Only public work is named or linked. Private repositories appear as counts.
- The generated CV carries no e-mail address and no phone number.
- Almost never use comments. Keep one only for a constraint the code cannot express.
- Structure is in `project_structure.mdc`, commands in `dev_workflow.mdc`, the stack in `tech_stack.mdc`.
